  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIt is unclear whether this follows the same steps as [show-the-picker](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#show-the-picker,-if-applicable), which checks and consumes the user activation. Currently, no browser checks or consumes the user activation for clicking case.",
